Package: gamepi-kiosk
Version: 0.1.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gamepi <archie2x@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: greetd, cage, xwayland, dbus-daemon, libpam-systemd, acl, systemd, init-system-helpers, adduser
Description: Gamepi kiosk session and shared library configuration
 Starts an ES-DE AppImage inside Cage using greetd's PAM login session.
 Supplies shared configuration defaults and a library editing group.
